  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Arcforge Players Compendium</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you cause a creature’s total strain damage to exceed their strain score or deal enough damage to a mental ability score that the damage exceeds that ability score, the creature dies rather than suffering from the normal effects. Creatures killed this way who are resurrected maintain any strain damage.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/general-feats#toc45\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
